ConstraintRelay vendors no third-party source. It does, however, contain Python
*ports* of algorithms read from the agent harnesses it was measured against —
re-implementations written to predict those harnesses' behaviour without
shelling out to them. A port of a function is derived work, so each upstream is
named here.

