-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Measured corpora
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The measurements in PHASE1.md-PHASE5.md were taken against HKUDS/Vibe-Trading
(MIT) at commit dddf96e. That corpus is read from a checkout supplied at run
time and is never copied into this repository; `fieldtest/*/` runners rsync it
to a scratch directory and never write to the checkout they are given.

No corpus text is redistributed here. The recorded evidence files under
`fieldtest/` contain constraint text extracted from that MIT-licensed corpus for
the purpose of reporting what was measured; `fieldtest/phase5/audit.tsv` and the
inventory manifests quote short excerpts under the same MIT terms, with
attribution above.
